      "title": "Writing instructions",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Write the edit in plain English:\n  'Relight the scene with warm golden hour sunlight.'\n  'Place this person at the cafe table, holding a coffee.'\n  'Change her outfit to a red raincoat.'\n\nUnique face coming out generic? Append:\n  'Preserve the exact facial identity - distinguishing features: ...'\nand describe what makes the face distinctive.\n\ngrounding_px: how large the model 'sees' the input while reading your\ninstruction. 384-768 is the trained range. Getting doubled/split\ncompositions? LOWER it. The collapsed node below is the negative -\nonly used at CFG > 1; keep its prompt empty.\n\nfull nelson anal sex positions,A frontal view photo shows the woman and a Black man engaging in anal sex, the man's arms passed over her thighs and grabbed her head, The woman is riding on top of the man, who inserts his large, dark penis into her anus.\nThe woman, wearing black high heels, had her legs raised high above her head, making her entire body visible. The man's hands are hidden behind the woman's head.\n The woman's labia minora are open, revealing pink vaginal tissue. They are having sex in their bed at home\n\nRaw amateur snapshot, vertical thumbnail format. A gorgeous curvy girl with massive natural tits and a round, beautiful face is on her knees on the front deck of a luxury yacht, looking up at the camera with a dirty smirk. Two massively hung, muscular black men are standing on either side of her, their thick dicks resting on her shoulders. She is topless, messy wet hair. Bold white text at the bottom reads \"BLACKED RAW: YACHT EDITION\". Harsh direct flash, glossy sweaty skin, cheap phone camera aesthetic, unedited reality."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
